title: The Left Breaks Away
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year >= 2015 and farleft_strength >= 22 and left_relation < 40 and left_split_done != 1
priority: 350
max-visits: 1

= The Left Breaks Away

A coalition of left activists, disillusioned young voters, and third-party organizers is launching a challenge to our right flank, a candidate and a ballot line that could cost us close races.

- @left_split_negotiate: Negotiate a pact
- @left_split_attack: Treat them as spoilers
- @left_split_ignore: Ignore them

@left_split_negotiate
on-arrival: left_split_done = 1; left_relation += 12; farleft_strength -= 6; progressive_dissent -= 4; moderate_dissent += 4; biz_relation -= 2

A deal brings many back to the fold.

@left_split_attack
on-arrival: left_split_done = 1; left_relation -= 6; farleft_strength += 3; suburban_dem += 1*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 4

We call them spoilers. They call us sellouts.

@left_split_ignore
on-arrival: left_split_done = 1; farleft_strength += 2; young_dem -= 2*(1-dissent)

We hope they fade away.
